{"text": "Once upon a time there was a king, you may say, but you are wrong. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Once upon a time there was only a simple piece of wood. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> It was not expensive wood, but a common log that people burned in winter. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> One day this log came to the shop of an old carpenter named Master Antonio. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Everyone called him Master Cherry because his nose was red and shiny like a ripe cherry. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> When he saw the log, he was very happy and rubbed his hands together. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> I will make a leg for my little table with this, he said. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He picked up his sharp axe, but just then he heard a tiny voice. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Please do not hit me so hard, cried the voice. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Master Cherry looked all around the room, but he found nobody there. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Then he began to smooth the log, and the voice laughed, Stop, you are tickling me. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The poor old man fell down in fright, and his red nose turned blue.", "alignment": {"characters": ["O", "n", "c", "e", " ", "u", "p", "o", "n", " ", "a", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", " ", "t", "h", "e", "r", "e", " ", "w", "a", "s", " ", "a", " ", "k", "i", "n", "g", ",", " ", "y", "o", "u", " ", "m", "a", "y", " ", "s", "a", "y", ",", " ", "b", "u", "t", " ", "y", "o", "u", " ", "a", "r", "e", " ", "w", "r", "o", "n", "g", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "O", "n", "c", "e", " ", "u", "p", "o", "n", " ", "a", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", " ", "t", "h", "e", "r", "e", " ", "w", "a", "s", " ", "o", "n", "l", "y", " ", "a", " ", "s", "i", "m", "p", "l", "e", " ", "p", "i", "e", "c", "e", " ", "o", "f", " ", "w", "o", "o", "d", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "I", "t", " ", "w", "a", "s", " ",